  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Design component for SEMESTA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This component is dedicated to effectively design the SEMESTA Programme. Through this component, the programme team will be able to: (i) design a programme that aligns with the overarching FCDO&apos;s ODA strategy and goals; (ii) plan to optimise the use of resources while ensuring the funds available are allocated efficiently and effectively; (iii) identify potential risks and develop strategies to mitigate them; (iv) plan mechanisms for monitoring and evaluation that are essential to track progress; (v) correctly set the long-term outcomes and impacts of the programme</narrative>
  </description>
